{"text":"Mɑ kʋyɔɣɔtʋtʋ ntɛ́ sɩ: Mɑ pəntənɑ Tɑcɑɑ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ɩlɛ nyənɩ mɑ pətɔɔtəlɛ nɑ ń wɑɑsɩ-m.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mɑ kolontunɑɑ pɔɔsəɣənɑ nɑ mʋsʋŋ sɩ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Pəlee kɛ́ n kɑ́ sɩ nɑ pɑ́ sɔɔ nyɑ́ tɔɔ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ye pɑ tɑɑ nɔɣɔlʋ kɔmɑ mɑ wiiluɣu","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"pɔpɔtʋ tɔm kɛ́ ɩ yɔɣɔtəɣɩ sɩ ɩ hiki","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"timpi ɩ kɑ cɑɣɑnɑ-m tɔ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mpɑ pɑɑ cɑɑ-m tɔ pɑ kotiɣi kɛ́ nɑ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"pɑ́ wɛlətəɣɩ mɑ ɩsɑɣɑtʋ tɔm sɩ:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Kʋtɔŋ ɩsɑɣɑʋ hɩɩsənɑ-ɩ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ɩ kɑɑ kʋlɩ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Hɑlɩ mɑ tɑɑpɑlʋ kʋpɑŋ wei","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mɑ́ nɑ-ɩ tə nɩɩkɑɣɑ təmɑ tɔm","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nɑ tə́ tɔkɩ mɑ mʋtʋ tɔ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ɩ kʋlɑ mɑ tɔɔ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Hɑɩ, Tɑcɑɑ nyənɩ mɑ pətɔɔtəlɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nɑ ń kʋsɩ-m nɑ mɑ́ lɛɛtɩ-wɛ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"Mpi pɩɩ hʋlɩ sɩ n sɔɔlɑ-m tɔɣɔlɛ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wɑɑtʋ wei mɑ kolontunɑɑ kɑ́ yele koou","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"sɩ mpɛ pɑ kəlɑ-m tɔ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"N pɑɑsənɑ-m mɑ tɑmpɑnɑ təŋʋɣʋ tɔɔ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nɑ ń sɩɩ-m nyɑ́ ɩsɛntɑɑ kɛ tɑm tɔɔ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tɑcɑɑ Ɩsɔ wei nyɑ́ n kɛ́ Ɩsɛɣɛlɩ nyə́mɑ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ɩsɔ tɔɣɔlɛ teeli tʋ.